{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30634","headline":"襄州献卢尚书 · 姚鹄","name":"襄州献卢尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"立事成功尽远图，一方独与万方殊。\n藩臣皆竞师兵畧，相国今多揖庙谟。\n礼乐政行凋弊俗，歌谣声彻帝王都。\n即随凤诏归何处，祗是操持造化鑪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}